# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a temporary
#  folder before pyinstaller injects the rest of the bootloader to make it an executable.
#  Usually in the output directory
#  Gets bundled with the application during the build process
#  If a file is present in the project directory it is usually not part of the
#  generated executable, but is instead generated by an external hook and
#  therefore generated during the runtime.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

